<section class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">What a Tango does</h2>
  <div class="feature">
    <div>
      <p>
        Bravo receives ADS-B and passes it to the Go over Bluetooth. The Go
        shows it on its radar with the ADS-L and FLARM traffic. The pair warns
        you about traffic from all three.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your phone connects to the Go and gets all the traffic in one
        data stream, in FLARM NMEA format.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Go keeps broadcasting your position in ADS-L. A pilot who buys a
        Tango to see the airliners is also seen in ADS-L.
      </p>
    </div>
    <%= render "shared/tango" %>
  </div>
</section>

