      <h3>skyBlip Tango.</h3>
      <p>A Go and a Bravo. The Go has no buzzer, so Bravo sounds the alarm and vibrates. The Go also shows the alarm on its screen.</p>
      <p class="note">LilyGO T-Echo and Seeed SenseCAP MeshTracker X1.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>skyBlip Tango+.</h3>
      <p>A Go+ and a Bravo. The Go+ has its own buzzer and vibration motor. With a GPS fix, it takes over the alarm from a working Bravo. Bravo stays silent while the Go+ sounds.</p>
      <p class="note">LilyGO T-Echo Plus and Seeed SenseCAP MeshTracker X1.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

